source:
The leaves are swaying in the wind.{w}
A few fall down, and they soar around majestically.{w}
We're far enough from Eastcrown that they didn't wilt.{w}
It's amazing how much the spirits helped out our settlement.

target:
树叶在风中摇曳。{w}
几片飘落下来，庄严地盘旋飞舞。{w}
我们离东冠足够远，所以它们没有枯萎。{w}
众灵对我们的聚居地帮助之大，真是不可思议。
